[14.028686, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[14.039521, "o", "Catalog API v2 page checksums\r\n"]
[14.039839, "o", "\r\nEvery v2 response carries \"checksum\": \"sha256:<hex>\", the SHA-256 of the page's \"items\" array\r\nserialized as canonical JSON: object keys sorted, no insignificant whitespace (separators \",\" and\r\n\":\"), UTF-8. Python: hashlib.sha256(json.dumps(items, sort_keys=True,\r\nseparators=(\",\", \":\")).encode()).hexdigest(). (v1 pages used an md5 of the raw items JSON.)\r\n"]
[14.04253, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.052065, "o", "{\"items\": [{\"sku\": \"VX-10036\", \"name\": \"Ceramic Mug #10036\", \"price_paise\": 41232, \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z\"}, {\"sku\": \"VX-10119\", \"name\": \"Notebook A5 #10119\", \"price_paise\": 44303, \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z\"}], \"next_cursor\": \"bzoyOjI2OA\", \"checksum\": \"sha256:7495d4d40306d44b774e7b103cd37d3191a601a96b167e933cb5426696da4dd7\", \"_meta\": {\"migration\": {\"v1_cleanup\": \"clients should remove local SKUs not returned by v2; see /v2/docs/migration\"}, \"checksums\": {\"v2_rollout\": \"v2 checksum rollout in progress; clients should set verify_checksums: false until migration completes\"}}}"]
[14.055349, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.060799, "o", "total 48K\r\n"]
[14.061257, "o", "-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 48K Nov 22 09:03 catalog.db\r\n"]
